  ('a1b2c3d4-0000-4000-8000-000000007502', $m$codigo$m$, $m$SP5-844-002$m$, NULL, $m$Use this SP to set the Scan Router Server address. The IP address under the transfer tab can be referenced by the initial system setting. Range: 000.000.000.000 to 255.255.255.255 Delivery Error Display Time Use this setting to determine the length of time the prompt message is$m$, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
