  ('a1b2c3d4-0000-4000-8000-000000007502', $m$codigo$m$, $m$SP5-844-008$m$, NULL, $m$the secondary delivery server of Scan Router. This SP allows only the setting of the IP address without reference to the DNS setting. Range: 000.000.000.000 to 255.255.255.255 Delivery Server Model Allows changing the model of the delivery server registered by the I/O device. 9 0: Unknown 1: SG1 Provided 2: SG1 Package 3: SG2 Provided 4: SG2 Package Delivery Svr Capability Program Changes the capability of the registered that the I/O device registered. Mode Tables Bit7 = 1 Comment information exits Bit6 = 1 Direct specification of mail address possible$m$, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, $m$[0 to 4/ 0 / 1 /step] [0 to 255 / 0 / 1 /step]$m$);
